Description: Isoform-level biological interpretation of transcriptomic
    data.  Provides the 'IsoformicExperiment' class, a disk-backed
    (Parquet) container holding transcript, gene and exon level data for
    the same samples, fast DuckDB based readers for annotations and
    quantifications, summaries of isoform usage and diversity, and plots
    of isoform-level differential expression, expression profiles and
    genomic context.
